WEBVTT

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:21.820
Morning.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.820
Oh, good morning...

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.680
Jun! Hurry up!

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:28.220
I'm getting the trash can.

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:30.590
The trash collection comes early around here.

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:31.590
Coming!

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:34.000
It's fine. Drop them from there.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.330
Oh, okay.

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:36.730
Here it comes.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.640
Whoa! Too fast!

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:47.330
Sorry, niichan!

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:59.620
Hey, isn't this the notification
for school visitation day?

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:01.460
But we're...

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:03.220
I'll come see you.

00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:05.190
Like that's never happened before.

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:06.990
When is it?

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.840
It makes me happy to hear your brother's coming.

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:21.240
He's technically our guardian.

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:25.680
School visitation day... To
some people, it's kind of cruel.

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:27.620
You're right.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.750
If I think about it, he's the only one...

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:32.850
who never had anyone come
see him on school visitation day.

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:35.580
Our aunt in Tokyo was always busy, too...

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:38.530
Good for you, Jun-kun.

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:40.550
You better make yourself
look good for your brother.

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:44.800
It's not like I'm in elementary school anymore...

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:06.220
kanjouni aragau nayo
Don't fight back your emotions

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:08.590
sono ashiwo tomenna
Don't ever stop

00:02:08.590 --> 00:02:13.190
taoreru nowa mada hayaize
It's too soon to fall down

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:14.660
Breakin' through
Breakin' through

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:16.500
uchinukeyo
Pierce through

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.800
yamiwo hurihodoki
Free yourself from darkness

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:23.000
tadoritsuku bashowa hitotsusa
There is only one destination

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:26.770
hurueru sora
Quaking sky

00:02:29.010 --> 00:02:32.500
kazewa naniwo tsugeru
What is the wind telling me?

00:02:34.150 --> 00:02:38.590
Tadashii datoka soujanai toka
Right or wrong

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.720
kudaranai ronsouwa
Nonsensical arguments

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:44.330
kieya shinai kedo
Never go away

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:48.830
shinjita kotowo shinjinuku koto
Believe what you believe in

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.970
sono sakini bokurawa
At the end of it all

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:54.540
hikari mitsukeru darou
We will find the light

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:59.640
saa tokihanate ima
Now is the time to release it

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:02.410
kanjouni aragau nayo
Don't fight back your emotions

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:04.780
sono ashiwo tomenna
Don't ever stop

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:09.270
taoreru nowa mada hayaize
It's too soon to fall down

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:10.890
Breakin' through
Breakin' through

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.690
uchinukeyo
Pierce through

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:14.990
yamiwo hurihodoki
Free yourself from darkness

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:19.120
tadoritsuku bashowa hitotsusa
There is only one destination

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.410
Good morning.

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:40.380
Hey.

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:46.550
Who were you meeting with and what
were you getting from them last night?

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:50.330
Ito-san and his partner were watching you.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.930
Who is the unidentified body?

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:55.360
Did you really kill him?

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:02.440
You want me closer to you, but you
never tell me anything important.

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:06.460
I can't help you if you only come to me sometimes...

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:09.740
You don't look so well lately, either.

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:11.340
Come over for a check-up.

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:20.920
How did you get approval to use the GPS?

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:23.120
I didn't get it, of course.

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:28.460
If I requested one under my name,
the Chief would know right away.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:31.200
But if they find out you didn't get permission...

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:35.470
Not like I could've said I was
gonna use it to trail the Chief.

00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:36.960
It makes no difference.

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:41.670
Anyway... She must really like him.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:46.140
Ayanagi Police Station
Toyama Prefecture

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:06.370
You're going to cut funding?

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:08.940
Who is pressuring you into this?

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:11.070
It's partially my will, as well.

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:14.600
Your research has lost its initial focus.

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:17.840
Nothing has changed.

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:22.680
We've basically made the same mistakes.

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:26.590
We should've stopped before...

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.930
I understand where you stand now.

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:35.530
Go ahead and release all data
regarding the control pill.

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:38.120
All confidential files are being destroyed.

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:44.510
The retaliation will be unavoidable based
on the amount of funding you had received.

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:48.580
Nonetheless, humans must follow certain rules.

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:53.100
I will make the rules. Otherwise, people will...

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:55.480
What is it?

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:57.210
Yuji got away.

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:08.060
That's not nice to say.

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:10.620
I was just trying to scare him a little.

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:13.890
I told him he would be purged
since he lost his Persona.

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:17.270
Enough of your jokes, Sotaro.

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:18.530
Fine.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.480
I shall look for him.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:23.470
You all go and prepare for tonight.

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:48.190
Come in.

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:51.260
Well, it sure is chilly today.

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:55.400
You think so? It's not that bad.

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:57.710
I was raised in the South.

00:07:57.710 --> 00:08:01.440
I never wanted to work in a snowy place.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:03.000
Here, take a break.

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:07.140
Thank you.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:15.860
So your sister who owns an inn is also...

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:18.850
No, we're only half-related...

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:23.060
Things happened in the past, but...

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:27.130
We both appreciate our
good-for-nothing father now.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:34.030
As singles with no families, we've come
to appreciate each other as siblings.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:35.870
I see.

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:38.680
Chief's Office

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:40.520
Chief's Office
You're heading to the prefectural station today?

00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:41.450
Chief's Office
Yes.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:42.080
Chief's Office

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.480
Chief's Office
Take care.

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:44.040
Chief's Office

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:47.480
What's the matter?

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:05.630
That weird Persona user has stopped showing up.

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:07.840
It's better that way.

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:10.970
Hopefully, things will stay calm like this.

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:13.130
And the missing people will...

00:10:13.310 --> 00:10:14.400
Mm-hmm...
Yeah...

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:18.910
Hey, aren't those?

00:10:18.910 --> 00:10:20.550
It must be starting.

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:22.640
School visitation day, huh?

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.950
Why are you getting excited?

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:30.080
Hello? What's going on, aniki?

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:32.820
What!?

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.000
Kanzato Shigeru, Haruka, Yuki

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:43.770
Kanzato Shigeru, Haruka, Yuki
What's up with that?

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:46.310
I would understand if it were about work,

00:10:46.310 --> 00:10:49.240
but if you have the time to
call me out like this, then...

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:53.310
I wanted to do at least one thing before I left...

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:54.280
What?

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:56.350
I'll go...

00:10:56.350 --> 00:10:59.150
At the next opportunity... I promise.

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:03.460
What are you saying?

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:05.980
You got Jun's hopes up!

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:08.430
Why did you? Why did you do that this morning?

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:10.760
You're horrible, niichan.

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:13.800
You weren't like this before.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:25.300
I stole a list from your PC.

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:27.940
About the A Latents.

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:33.490
I saw the names of missing kids from this academy.

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:37.990
Detective Ito said they're all dead already.

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:41.830
He was acting like you were doing something bad.

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:47.070
I keep thinking that might be the
reason you wanted us to go away.

00:11:47.070 --> 00:11:53.340
Or you might be one of them... but
I told myself that's impossible.

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:58.170
Why didn't you hand over the list to Detective Ito?

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:00.570
Because...

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:03.580
Since when?

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:07.640
Since when were you able to use your Persona?

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:10.950
Since we moved here...

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:13.820
I see...

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:21.500
I'm the one who gave Jun the burden
of being able to sense people's feelings.

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:26.470
But that's because of ten years ago...

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:32.310
I heard from Eiko-san. If I were
in your place, I would've also...

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:40.150
If you guys hadn't come back...

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:47.450
If you didn't return to this place, perhaps
neither of you would have awakened.

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:50.730
Why did you have to come back?

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:56.700
Gravestone:
Kanzato Shigeru, Haruka, Yuki

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:03.200
Give this to Eiko.

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:15.880
What is this?

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:18.520
Take care of Jun, Shin.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:31.040
I might not make it, but I'll try to get back on time!

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:49.120
In this case, y=4x+3 is one and 2x+y=21 is two.

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:01.740
Hey, why is his brother on the bus?

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:03.700
It definitely was...

00:14:06.510 --> 00:14:09.140
I'm sorry, he noticed, huh?

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:11.780
The Chief's meeting is already over.

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:15.220
There's a high possibility he met up
with his brother at City Memorial Park.

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:18.980
Do you have any idea where
he would go afterwards?

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:22.780
Be honest and don't try to hide anything.

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.420
I'm sorry.

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:32.330
I apologize.

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:38.510
I had a feeling my brothers
were Persona users, but...

00:14:38.510 --> 00:14:40.240
I understand.

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:42.210
I had siblings before, too.

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:46.280
There has definitely been a decrease
in the number of Persona users.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:48.310
It strays from our initial plan...

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:54.910
but the best thing to do would be
to make them into an elite team.

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:57.890
Now that their abilities have been confirmed,

00:14:57.890 --> 00:14:59.830
I have no objection against the list.

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:05.170
There's no reason for you to keep
taking the control pills anymore.

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.220
Right...

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:08.540
Kanzato...

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:11.230
Where are you heading right now?

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:23.210
We're so sorry.

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:27.320
What are you all doing here?

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:31.460
The teacher yelled at us for leaving our class.

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:32.390
What?

00:15:32.390 --> 00:15:35.330
We thought it would be better
than having nobody here.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:39.790
I thought it'd make a difference if he
saw us like this when he turned around...

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:45.460
Ryo!

00:16:54.840 --> 00:17:01.850
There are those who are trying
to manage and control all people.

00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:04.550
For a long time...

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:11.160
They have existed as shadows and have
dispersed into various organizations.

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:16.160
They work to create confusion
and hinder progress in the world.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:19.760
You're working for some of them, too.

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:25.610
They control most of what
humans come in contact with.

00:17:25.610 --> 00:17:33.750
They are, slowly but surely, taking
away the power of people's minds...

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:41.310
That's the cause of the decrease in Personas.

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:52.200
This only means they are forcing
the people to abandon their psyche.

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:58.770
This also implies the people are
abandoning their own futures.

00:17:58.770 --> 00:18:05.280
I decided to take advantage of their
financial abilities and nothing else.

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:09.550
In order to unite all unconsciousness...

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:14.720
and reunite the people with their lost psyches...

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:18.120
A mere sophism.

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:22.060
You just don't want to give up...

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:26.160
You're refusing to quit just because of her.

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:30.440
Even if you're being controlled
by those in the shadows.

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:34.640
It proves humans can only do so much.

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:38.870
Are you going to kill me again?

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:41.650
I came to end it all.

00:18:41.650 --> 00:18:44.980
Even if you keep piling up your sins...

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:50.710
You will never... be able to have her.

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:12.610
Ryo!

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:30.190
Accept your destiny.

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:34.000
You will not have...

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:35.560
Shin or Jun...

00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:41.100
She... is wandering...

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:46.280
Within something that's so deep and calm...

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:49.580
Resisting the distortion...

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:54.290
Then, Ayane-!!

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.130
Where?

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:34.530
Where are you?

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:36.460
Ryo!

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:46.500
Stay away...

00:20:54.010 --> 00:20:54.980
Jun?

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:57.570
Niichan...

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:01.560
Shin... niichan...

00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:03.720
Jun! What's the matter!?

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:04.690
Jun!

00:21:46.830 --> 00:21:53.870
Omotai kusariwo
The heavy chain

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:59.610
ima hazushite agemashou
I will take it off for you

00:21:59.610 --> 00:22:04.890
jiyuuni naretara
Once you're free

00:22:04.890 --> 00:22:11.960
kokowo habataite yukeruwa
You'll be able to fly away

00:22:11.960 --> 00:22:18.530
atashiga samatage
I stood in your way

00:22:18.530 --> 00:22:27.010
ubatte kita madaminu sekai e
and took that world you haven't seen

00:22:27.010 --> 00:22:31.650
tamerau nonara
If you're going to hesitate

00:22:31.650 --> 00:22:40.250
huriharatte ageru sono udewo
I will free that arm for you

00:22:40.250 --> 00:22:44.790
soshite tookue
Then to faraway

00:22:44.790 --> 00:22:50.960
dekirudake tookue
As far away as possible

00:22:50.960 --> 00:22:54.270
aishiteruno
"I love you"

00:22:54.270 --> 00:22:57.940
ikanaideyo
"Don't leave me"

00:22:57.940 --> 00:23:04.900
koware chaukara
I will break

00:23:14.390 --> 00:23:18.690
Become the shadow in between
and stand by the shore.

00:23:18.690 --> 00:23:22.900
Listen to the moaning of what lies deep within.

00:23:22.900 --> 00:23:25.830
The twisting body, the cry.

00:23:25.830 --> 00:23:29.400
A scab that peels with the pain.

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:34.100
Once again, bring calm to the Sea of Psyche.

00:23:34.610 --> 00:23:37.110
The distortion must be corrected.

00:23:37.110 --> 00:23:42.070
Along with the distortion's creator.
